  "prefLabel": "Env-C 202.13 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 202.13 “Person” means, for each proceeding, “person” as defined by the statute pursuant to which the department regulates the subject matter of the proceeding.\n\nSource. #8851-A, eff 3-25-07",
